# Art style

Before generating or importing images, textures, 3D, video, or VFX, read [`docs/art-style.md`](docs/art-style.md) and prepend [`docs/art/prompt-lock.md`](docs/art/prompt-lock.md).

- North star: **Wuthering Waves–class 3D anime**, dark jewel color, bright rims. Inspiration only — do not copy IP.
- Summer `summer_generate_image`: `style` **must** be `"anime"`. Never leave default `"realistic"`.
- Use `options.negative_prompt` from the prompt lock.
- If `game/art/_style/` has approved stills, use them as references. Do not use `game/art/town/` Kenney/graybox as style.
- Import into `game/art/{characters,hub,worlds,ui,vfx,gear}/`. Keep `_style/` for lock refs only.
- To change the look, bump the lock version in those two docs in the same change. Do not drift per-asset.
